                        <occupation>Städerska</occupation>
                    </person>, <trait type="character">snäll</trait>, <trait type="character">ordentlig</trait>, <trait type="skill">kunnig i sömnad</trait>, sökes till <date when="1906-10-24" type="begin">24/10</date> af <person sex="unspecified" role="employer">liten officersfamilj</person> i <placeName type="employment" ref="#kristianstad">Kristianstad</placeName>. Svar med <ref type="reference">betyg</ref> till <person sex="female" role="mediator">Fru Rietz</person>, <placeName type="application">Sölvesborgs Slott</placeName>.</p>
